            "alt": {
              "segmentId": "m00131:alt:fig-00002-alt",
              "text": "A reaction of 2-chloro-2-methylpropane in the presence of water and ethanol at 65 degrees Celsius, yields 2-methyl-2-propanol (64%) and 2-methylpropene (36%)."
            },
            "src": "../../media/OChem_11_10_002.jpg",
